      "body": "We've got SSK depth represented as an attribute.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1108513/184156981-7ef4c948-1dec-4b20-aa44-14e00bef9a39.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nBut, attributes only relate to the present.  When we're planning actions, it's \"State\" that we set for the future.\r\n\r\nSo, for SSK I think we should use \"State\" values of:\r\n- Deep transit\r\n- Deep evade\r\n- PD search\r\n- PD evade\r\n- PD Launch weapons\r\n- Surface search\r\n- Surface attack\r\n- Surface evade\r\n\r\nPlayers can then use these states to plan a future attack.",
